# Uvagf · 22 · N Xhoreargrf-fglyr pbagebyyre

## Uvag 1

Fgneg jvgu gur dhrhr naq nfx: jung qbrf vg unir gb erzrzore nobhg n xrl? N xrl pna or jnvgvat,
cebprffvat, be obgu "cebprffvat naq nqqrq ntnva". Bar beqrerq yvfg vf abg rabhtu gb nafjre "vf
guvf xrl jnvgvat?" dhvpxyl be gb xabj jung Qbar zhfg qb. Xrrc gur beqre va n fyvpr naq gur
zrzorefuvc va frgf (`znc[X]fgehpg{}`), nyy thneqrq ol bar zhgrk. Sbe "Trg oybpxf hagvy gurer vf n
xrl", ybbx ng `flap.Pbaq`: vg vf n zhgrk cyhf "jnvg hagvy fbzrbar gryyf zr gur fgngr punatrq".
Gur fgber, Erpbapvyr naq Eha ner fznyyre guna gurl ybbx bapr gur dhrhr vf evtug.

## Uvag 2

Gur dhrhr gevpx vf pyvrag-tb'f: xrrc n `qvegl` frg ("arrqf cebprffvat") naq n `cebprffvat` frg.
Nqq chgf gur xrl va qvegl, naq chgf vg va gur fyvpr bayl vs vg vf abg cebprffvat. Trg zbirf vg
sebz qvegl gb cebprffvat. Qbar erzbirf vg sebz cebprffvat naq, vs vg vf qvegl ntnva, nccraqf vg gb
gur fyvpr. Jvgu gung, "arire gjb jbexref ba bar xrl" naq "ab ybfg Nqq" obgu ubyq ol pbafgehpgvba.
Jnvg ba gur Pbaq va n `sbe` ybbc, abg na `vs`, naq Oebnqpnfg ba FuhgQbja, be bayl bar bs gur
oybpxrq Trgf jnxrf hc. Sbe gur fgber, rirel znc lbh gnxr va be unaq bhg zhfg or pybarq, naq gur
irefvba purpx naq gur jevgr va Hcqngr zhfg unccra haqre gur fnzr ybpx. Sbe Erpbapvyr, hfr gur
pbzzn-bx sbez `jnag, bx := qrfverq[anzr]`: n avy fcrp fgvyy zrnaf "qrfverq".

## Uvag 3

- Dhrhr: svryqf `dhrhr []X`, `qvegl`, `cebprffvat`, `snvyherf znc[X]vag`, `fuhgQbja obby`, n
  zhgrk naq n `*flap.Pbaq` znqr sebz vg. Nqq: erghea vs fuhg qbja be qvegl; znex qvegl; erghea vs
  cebprffvat; nccraq naq Fvtany. Trg: jnvg ba gur Pbaq va n ybbc juvyr gur fyvpr vf rzcgl naq gur
  dhrhr vf abg fuhg qbja; vs gur fyvpr vf fgvyy rzcgl, erghea snyfr; bgurejvfr cbc gur sebag naq
  zbir gur xrl sebz qvegl gb cebprffvat. Qbar: erzbir sebz cebprffvat; vs qvegl, nccraq naq
  Fvtany. FuhgQbja: frg gur synt, Oebnqpnfg.
- NqqNsgre: `q <= 0` → Nqq. Bgurejvfr nfx gur pybpx gb pnyy Nqq(x) nsgre q; gur fuhgqbja purpx
  vafvqr Nqq unaqyrf yngr gvzref. NqqEngrYvzvgrq: ernq naq vaperzrag `snvyherf[x]` haqre gur ybpx,
  haybpx, naq bayl gura pnyy NqqNsgre (n Zhgrk vf abg erragenag). Gur qrynl: fgneg ng onfrQrynl naq
  qbhoyr a gvzrf, fgbccvat nf fbba nf gur arkg qbhoyvat jbhyq cnff znkQrynl. Arire pbzchgr `2^a`
  qverpgyl.
- Fgber: n znc bs bowrpgf, n irefvba pbhagre, n EJZhgrk. Rirel jevgr: `irefvba++`, fgber n qrrc
  pbcl jvgu gung irefvba, erghea nabgure qrrc pbcl. Hcqngr pbzcnerf `bow.ErfbheprIrefvba` jvgu gur
  fgberq bar orsber jevgvat, haqre gur jevgr ybpx. Yvfg: pbyyrpg pbcvrf, fbeg ol anzr.
- Erpbapvyr: Trg bapr. Vs gur reebe vf abg avy naq abg ReeAbgSbhaq, erghea vg. Gura fjvgpu ba gjb
  obbyrnaf, "jnagrq" naq "rkvfgf": qryrgr, perngr, pbzcner jvgu `zncf.Rdhny`, be frg gur qrfverq
  fcrp ba gur bowrpg lbh ernq (vg xrrcf vgf ErfbheprIrefvba) naq Hcqngr. Gerng ReeAbgSbhaq sebz
  Qryrgr nf fhpprff.
- Eha: inyvqngr, fgneg Jbexref tbebhgvarf (JnvgTebhc), rnpu ybbcvat ba Trg hagvy vg ergheaf
  snyfr; sbe rnpu anzr: Qbar va rirel pnfr (qrsre), fxvc gur jbex vs pgk vf qbar (purpx nsgre
  Trg), Erpbapvyr, gura NqqEngrYvzvgrq be Sbetrg. Ba Eha'f bja tbebhgvar, radhrhr rirelguvat bapr,
  gura ybbc ba n fryrpg bire `pgk.Qbar()` naq n Gvpxre: ba gur gvpx radhrhr ntnva; ba pgk qbar
  pnyy FuhgQbja, jnvg sbe gur jbexref, erghea avy. Qbvat gur erflap evtug gurer zrnaf gurer vf ab
  rkgen tbebhgvar gb jnvg sbe.
